+                    "settings as in SDR, on the perceptual PQ values; costs about 33 MB of memory traffic "
+                    "a frame at 1080p more than HDR without it, as much as FXAA costs in SDR). Not with "
+                    "frame generation, a debug view or the test pattern. Off: FXAA is skipped while HDR "
+                    "output is active, as before")
+    .lifecycle(rex::cvar::Lifecycle::kHotReload);
